 ```
 
+`createPatch(from, to)` creates an RFC 6902 JSON Patch that transforms one JSON document into
+another. It compares objects and arrays recursively, emitting only the member- or element-level
+operations needed for the change, and does not mutate either input.
+
+```ts
+import { createPatch } from 'json-toolkit';
+
+createPatch(
+  { service: { retries: 2 } },
+  { service: { retries: 3 } },
+); // [{ op: 'replace', path: '/service/retries', value: 3 }]
+```
+
 ## JSON Merge Patch
 
 `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
